{"title":"2015 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/5/3a5ec5e5f8284a03272f5e891f1cab90141f8077.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{16 \\times \\sqrt{16}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"93\" height=\"35\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/1/e41fe8a60e2b4ec4481c5aaf408795ae6ff8b0d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2^{1} \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 2^{2} \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 2^{3} \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 2^{4} \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 2^{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"388\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/5/3a5ec5e5f8284a03272f5e891f1cab90141f8077.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{16 \\times \\sqrt{16}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"93\" height=\"35\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/6/f3627b2c09be15d477d2caa79d5262afb7594e1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\sqrt{16 \\times 4} =\\sqrt{64}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"143\" height=\"22\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/2/f12d40180fb3c9172f4357258800c47ec35e6b04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=8$\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/5/d2550f647a60e46fafbf87b1926e1837bd1e0bec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } 2^{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"84\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can use the fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/2/9b2ab0ce560a0f76b30b3842c0fe3806043e4d5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{4} = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"58\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/5/2f5f8d0f23094899c40efd82cf530a67cb746661.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{x} = x^{\\frac{1}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"72\" height=\"23\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/2/5824816b04404f3a9e921df5c7a6040cf36ac3b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a^{b})^{c} = a^{bc}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"85\" height=\"22\" /> (meaning that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/a/30a005f414ca561b06071bd647b0c904ecb86cf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{a^b} = (a^b)^{\\frac{1}{2}} = a^{\\frac{b}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"143\" height=\"25\" />), and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/6/11603ab6c79a6a801063f7e1bb759c2250a7608a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{b} \\times a^{c} = a^{b + c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"113\" height=\"19\" />. This gives:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/0/c70c38b2c00f99cff1b52a0ad49e9afd6c88f916.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{16 \\times \\sqrt{16}} = \\sqrt{2^{4} \\times \\sqrt{2^{4}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"206\" height=\"35\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/a/03ad8d52822c2c647f918b22ff2077ab9d983f77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\sqrt{2^{4} \\times 2^{\\frac{4}{2}}} = \\sqrt{2^{4} \\times 2^{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"192\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/6/a3686699639f8d0b94d14beff3a55373d7159515.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\sqrt{2^{4 + 2}} = \\sqrt{2^6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"125\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/a/3aa4be8078025b3b9dd8d59d2373331b721b2d1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=2^{\\frac{6}{2}} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } 2^{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"128\" height=\"32\" />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Pascal (page does not exist)\">2015 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Pascal Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 9 (page does not exist)\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2015 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 9 (page does not exist)\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/ind